# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LOCAL environment            (build flavor: local  ->  npm run android:local)
# Backend: your machine's Laravel dev server (php artisan serve, port 8000)
#
# NOTE on host address:
#   - iOS simulator              -> http://localhost:8000
#   - Android emulator (AVD)     -> http://10.0.2.2:8000   (localhost = the emulator itself)
#   - Physical device on Wi‑Fi   -> http://<your-LAN-IP>:8000  (e.g. 192.168.1.5)
#   Edit API_PATH / FTP_PATH1 below to match how you run the app.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
