# iOS-restricted Google Maps key (bundle com.tourkokan, Maps SDK for iOS enabled).
# Feeds BOTH GMSApiKey in Info.plist and src/Services/mapProvider.js.
# Leave EMPTY to use Apple Maps on iOS — never leave a junk value here,
# the Google Maps SDK aborts the process on a bad key.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_IOS=
